<div id="top"></div>
<section class="hero container">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span><%= theme.hero_label %></div>
    <h1><%= theme.hero_title %><br><%= theme.hero_title_second %><span class="hero-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></h1>
    <p><%= theme.hero_description %></p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button-primary" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">探索文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="button-secondary" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">关于我 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-footnote"><span class="footnote-line"></span> 技术 · 生活 · 灵感 · 还有更多</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-art-inner">
    <div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
    <div class="art-paper paper-back"><span>OBSERVE</span><b>02</b></div>
    <div class="art-paper paper-front"><span>FIELD NOTES · 001</span><strong>在平凡的<br>日子里，<br><em>保持好奇。</em></strong><i>✺</i><small>COLLECTING THE MOMENTS THAT MATTER</small></div>
    <div class="art-badge">IDEAS<br>GROW<br>HERE <span>↗</span></div>
    <div class="art-spark spark-one">✳</div><div class="art-spark spark-two">✦</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="intro-strip"><div class="container intro-inner"><span>01 / ABOUT THIS SPACE</span><p>让想法有地方安放，让热爱有迹可循。<span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></p></div></section>
<section class="topics-section container" aria-labelledby="topics-heading">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="section-label">FIND YOUR PATH / 从这里读起</p><h2 id="topics-heading">两条阅读路线<span class="heading-mark">.</span></h2></div><a class="section-link" href="<%- url_for('/categories/') %>">浏览所有分类 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="topics-grid">
    <a class="topic-card topic-technical" href="<%- url_for('/categories/机器人技术/') %>"><span class="topic-index">01 / ROBOTICS & ENGINEERING</span><span class="topic-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><strong>机器人与技术</strong><span class="topic-description">开发笔记、问题排查，以及每一次求证的过程。</span><span class="topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="topic-card topic-life" href="<%- url_for('/categories/生活随笔/') %>"><span class="topic-index">02 / LIFE & OBSERVATION</span><span class="topic-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><strong>生活与随笔</strong><span class="topic-description">阅读、日常与那些值得慢慢记录的瞬间。</span><span class="topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="posts-section container" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="section-label">THE JOURNAL / 文章手记</p><h2 id="latest-heading"><%= theme.featured_label %><span class="heading-mark">.</span></h2></div><a class="section-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">查看全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <% if (page.posts.length) { %>
    <div class="posts-grid"><% page.posts.each(function(post, index) { %><%- partial('_partial/post-card', {post: post, index: index}) %><% }) %></div>
    <% if (page.total > 1) { %><nav class="pagination" aria-label="文章分页"><%- paginator({prev_text: '← 上一页', next_text: '下一页 →'}) %></nav><% } %>
  <% } else { %><p class="empty-state">第一篇文章正在路上。稍后再来看看吧。</p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="quote-section"><div class="container quote-inner"><span class="quote-symbol">“</span><blockquote>把每一次探索，都变成下一次出发的起点。</blockquote><span class="quote-small">A LITTLE NOTE TO MYSELF</span></div></section>
